{"id":"1f2a9a9bf39ac82d","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-spectral-radius.md","title":"Spectral Radius","display":"df-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spectral-radius","aliases":["58-df-spectral-radius","58-df-zfc-analysis2-spectral-radius"],"display":"df-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spectral-radius"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spectral-radius</span><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-spectral-radius</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectral-radius — Spectral Radius"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,a,r\\in V\\land r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,a,r\\in V\\land r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Invertible}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{Invertible}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicates with algebra structure explicit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S:V^6\\to V\\land\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S:V^6\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S:V^6\\to V\\land\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S:V^6\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (operators with algebra structure explicit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2SpectralRadius}_S:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times A\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2SpectralRadius}_S:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times A\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}unital} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}unital} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}invertible} \\vdash \\operatorname{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a=1_A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}invertible} \\vdash \\operatorname{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a=1_A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\operatorname{Spectrum}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\operatorname{Spectrum}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}radius} \\vdash \\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\lambda|:\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}radius} \\vdash \\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\lambda|:\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Spectrum}_S(x;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2SpectralRadius}_S(r,a)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land a\\in A\\land r=\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}radius\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2SpectralRadius}_S(r,a)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land a\\in A\\land r=\\operatorname{SpectralRadius}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spectral radius formula: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_A(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\|x^n\\|_A^{1/n}\">\\(\\rho_A(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\|x^n\\|_A^{1/n}\\)</span> for the displayed complex unital Banach algebra.</li>\n<li>Gelfand–Mazur theorem: every complex Banach division algebra is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(x)\">\\(\\sigma(x)\\)</span> is compact and nonempty for Banach algebras.</li>\n<li>The two-place compatibility alias now binds its algebra carrier, operations, norm, and unit; the former clause read all five as free parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A,x,a,r\\in V\\land r\